 "prepText": "AURON · 2 OF 3 “Your party is ready.” The tabs are for later. Start the battle. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE PARTY PREP IX · YOJIMBO — CAVERN OF THE STOLEN FAYTH — THE LAST CHAMBER T Tidus S.LV 30 Y Yuna S.LV 32 K Kimahri S.LV 25 A Auron S.LV 35 W Wakka S.LV 30 L Lulu S.LV 30 R Rikku S.LV 42 CHAPTER STATS SPHERE GRID EQUIPMENT ITEMS OVERDRIVE FFX · IX Yojimbo A Guardian's Last Duty Lulu guarded one summoner before Yuna, and that summoner died in this cave without ever being sent. Her aeon still answers her, and every blow it takes brings its killing stroke closer. the last chamber, cold light the long blade, drawn Lady Ginnem, never sent OBJECTIVES ??? Let an aeon take Zanmato Defeat Yojimbo TIP Spells land in full and swords at about half. Each action aimed at him fills his gauge, and at 100 comes Zanmato, 9,999 to all three: have an aeon out by then. START BATTLE L Lulu HP 1375/1375 · MP 290/290 BLACK MAGE K Kimahri HP 2310/2310 · MP 130/130 STOIC Y Yuna HP 1500/1500 · MP 270/270 SUMMONER",
